source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Make organizations and manage who is in them.

Usage: ink org <COMMAND>

Commands
  create  Make an organization, with you as its owner
  list    The organizations you are a member of
  member  Who is in an organization

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink org --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
